     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">set</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1234</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>nitems </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">15</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>d1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> d2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nitems</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ncol</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>d2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> d2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>d2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> d2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">group1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> d1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">group2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> d2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>itemtype </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;dich&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> nitems</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>N </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">500</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>dataset1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> simdata</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nitems</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> d1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> itemtype</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>mod</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mirt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dataset1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">itemtype </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Rasch&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#ability is 2.295489</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>fscores</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mod</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">response</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pattern </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">15</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span></div></code></div><br><br><br>When we know the theta of whole test,say 2.295489 in the example,what&#39;s corresponding probability?<br><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://i.postimg.cc/rp2jJF0X/rr.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://i.postimg.cc/rp2jJF0X/rr.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472848880000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0LfFroL2CSqdcjUG0GGbuM\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/cy5EU4bO9TfKmtZ_vW5BLfXtTHpdl2OQD4vcyrvNFkhlZb-FSN9uAn_H1qEi8Na5mvM_1h-ftw=w5000-h5000\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div>I know there&#39;s probtrace function,but only workable for single item.<br> </div>"
